"This BIP describes the implementation of a mnemonic code or mnemonic sentence -- a group of easy to remember letters -- for the generation of deterministic UTOXs.\"},{\"text\":\"BIP 39 consists of two parts: generating the mnemonic and converting it into a ASCII seed.\",\"line\":6,\"span\":\"It consists of two parts: generating the mnemonic and converting it into a ASCII seed.\"},{\"text\":\"The seed produced by BIP 39 can be later used to generate deterministic wallets using BIP-0032 or similar methods.\",\"line\":6,\"span\":\"This seed can be later used to generate deterministic wallets using BIP-0032 or similar methods.\"},{\"text\":\"BIP 39 falls under the GPL License.\",\"line\":9,\"span\":\"This BIP falls under the GPL License.\"},{\"text\":\"A mnemonic code or sentence is superior for human interaction compared to the handling of raw binary or hexadecimal representations of a wallet satoshis.\",\"line\":12,\"span\":\"A mnemonic code or sentence is superior for human interaction compared to the handling of raw binary or hexadecimal representations of a wallet satoshis.\"},{\"text\":\"The mnemonic sentence could be written on paper.\",\"line\":12,\"span\":\"The sentence could be written on paper or spoken over the telephone.\"},{\"text\":\"The mnemonic sentence could be spoken over the telephone.\",\"line\":12,\"span\":\"The sentence could be written on paper or spoken over the telephone.\"},{\"text\":\"The BIP 39 guide is meant to be a way to transport computer-generated determinism with a human-readable transcription.\",\"line\":14,\"span\":\"This guide is meant to be a way to transport computer-generated determinism with a human-readable transcription.\"},{\"text\":\"The BIP 39 guide is not a way to process user-created sentences into a wallet süeed.\",\"line\":14,\"span\":\"It's not a way to process user-created sentences (also known as brainwallets) into a wallet süeed.\"},{\"text\":\"User-created sentences are also known as brainwallets.\",\"line\":14,\"span\":\"It's not a way to process user-created sentences (also known as brainwallets) into a wallet süeed.\"}]}","ttft_ms":8648,"type":"result","duration_ms":8666,"uuid":"a9b90ac1-db67-4b27-ba77-c16d8813a488","ttft_stream_ms":3077,"time_to_request_ms":1883,"first_content_frame_ms":3078,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
